  "goodToKnow": "Die Konsole is a console: eine Spielkonsole (games console), die Mittelkonsole (centre console in a car), and in computing, the command line. Originally an architectural term, it's a bracket or corbel supporting a shelf or ledge. Germany's Gamescom in Cologne is one of the world's largest gaming fairs. From French console. Plural: die Konsolen."
